Package: com.samcejko.wikie
Name: Wikie
Version: 1.0.8
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Offline Wikipedia and ZIM reader for iOS 5-10
 Wikie brings the world's knowledge to iOS 5-10 devices without an internet
 connection. Supports both modern and legacy .zim archives (v5/v6) with
 Zstandard and Deflate decompression, instant title index search,
 offline UIWebView rendering, iTunes File Sharing, built-in Wi-Fi upload
 and an online catalog downloader.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Education
Depends: firmware (>= 5.0), firmware (<< 11.0)
Icon: file:///Applications/Wikie.app/Icon.png
